      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        现代网络通信在追求高速传输的同时，安全加密是绝不可妥协的底线要求。了解加密算法的硬件支持，能够帮助我们在客户端中挑选最高效的算法配置。
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
